ind":"announcement","title":"Minor improvements","summary":"1. Fixed an issue where too many package labels could be displayed at the same time, blocking the view. 2. The game now pauses when the system menu is opened.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T03:19:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951308960","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4907570-1840944183776731","game_id":"steam-4907570","kind":"announcement","title":"Minor Improvements","summary":"1.Added a step ladder. 2.Removed the physics bounce effect when precisely placing packages. Packages can now be placed smoothly and steadily. 3.Reduced the slightly strange-looking dust particle effects in the air.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T13:11:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183776731","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4907570-1839041357025645","game_id":"steam-4907570","kind":"announcement","title":"Potentially fixed an issue where package information would sometimes not appear","summary":"Attempted to fix an issue where package information would sometimes not appear when hovering over a package. Also, I haven't had much time to work on updates over the past two weeks because I was traveling. I'll be working on implementing many of the suggestions I've received into the game, so stay tuned!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-23T04:07:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357025645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4907570-1838407329268827","game_id":"steam-4907570","kind":"announcement","title":"Fixed a bug where packages could be knocked down by player collisions.","summary":"Fixed a bug where packages could be knocked down by player collisions.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-21T12:00:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329268827","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4907570-1838407329264736","game_id":"steam-4907570","kind":"announcement","title":"Optimized some details and fixed several bugs.","summary":"1. Fixed a bug where package boxes could fly away when opening purchased packages from the shop. 2. Improved some game environments to make them feel more logical and natural. The game will continue to receive optimizations and bug fixes. If you have any suggestions, please feel free to leave a comment, and I will do my best to improve the game. Since this game is developed by me alone, some unusual bugs may not always be fixed perfectly. Thank you for your understanding. If possible, attaching ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T04:46:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329264736","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4907570-1838407329263115","game_id":"steam-4907570","kind":"announcement","title":"Fixed some issues where packages could get stuck inside walls.","summary":"Fixed some issues where packages could get stuck inside walls.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-19T05:58:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329263115","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:28:20Z"